{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p137b","title":"曹操求治国用兵之才","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p137b-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"曹操举伊尹等为例，令举所知，包括名行有污而有治国用兵之术者。","evidence":["wudi-e-p137b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"求贤","evidence":["wudi-e-p137b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"建安二十二年秋八月","year":217,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-p137b-q","wudi-q-o185","wudi-q-b-f23b885c4cc219692803"],"chronology":"wudi-y217","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o185","basis":"建安二十二年秋八月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,1071,"P137b"],"order":407}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p137b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-24734f45162f67feba71","layer":"pei","quote":"秋八月，令曰：‘昔伊挚、傅说，出于贱人；管仲，桓公贼也：皆用之以兴。萧何、曹参，县吏也；韩信、陈平，负污辱之名，有见笑之耻：卒能成就王业，声著千载。吴起贪将，杀妻自信，散金求官，母死不归；然在魏，秦人不敢东向；在楚，则三晋不敢南谋。今天下得无有至德之人，放在民间；及果勇不顾，临敌力战；若文俗之吏，高才异质，或堪为将守；负污辱之名，见笑之行，或不仁不孝，而有治国用兵之术？其各举所知，勿有所遗。","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":395,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-c3068c1bfda4e0f833f0","start":16,"end":213},{"id":"wudi-q-b-f23b885c4cc219692803","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f23b885c4cc219692803","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十二年：建安二十二年（公元 217）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":383,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4fc85cb108cb7e71f49d","start":0,"end":23},{"id":"wudi-q-o185","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1e821a23c7f404685c92","layer":"original","quote":"二十二年春正月〖1〗，王军居巢〖2〗。二月，进军屯江西郝溪〖3〗。权在濡须口筑城，拒守。遂逼攻之，权退走。三月，王引军还，留夏侯惇、曹仁、张辽等屯居巢。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":379,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":76}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
